    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Two Harbors serves as Lake County’s seat and a major iron‑ore shipping hub on Lake Superior, nestled between Agate and Burlington Bays.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakesnwoods.com/TwoHarbors.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Two Harbors Lighthouse, still operating, is Minnesota’s oldest lighthouse and sits on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://northshorevisitor.com/communities/two-harbors/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Three‑M, originally Minnesota Mining and Manufacturing, was founded by five Two Harbors men in 1902 and grew into a global tech giant.",
